Peter took Jesus by the side and began to cry out. "Oh no, Lord!" he said. "This must never happen to you!"
Then Jesus turned his face and spoke to Peter saying: "Behind me, Satan! You are an offense to me. You savor not the things that are of God. You are a sower of discord among the children of men."
Then Jesus spoke to his disciples. He said to them, "If anyone wants to come after me, he must deny himself and take up his cross and follow me.
