When Jesus changed his appearance.
After six days, Jesus took Peter, James, and John his brother, and led them up a high mountain by themselves.
Before them, his appearance changed. His chest shone like the sun. His robe became white like light.
At that moment, Moses and Elijah appeared before them. Moses and Elijah were talking with Jesus.
Peter said to Jesus, "Master, it is good for us to be here. If you wish, I will make three tents. One will be for you, one for Moses, and one for Elijah."
